            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Exercise mein das multiple choice, das mukhtasar (short) aur aath tafseeli (long) sawal hain. Sawal neeche kitab ki tarah English mein hain. Multiple choice ke jawab is lesson ke table mein hain; mukhtasar aur tafseeli sawalon ke jawab un ke topics ke Roman Urdu lessons mein self-check ki shakal mein hain."
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "Multiple choice sawal"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "1. A computer network is:"
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "ordered": false,
            "items": [
              "(a) A single computer system",
              "(b) A group of connected computers and devices",
              "(c) A software program",
              "(d) A storage device"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "2. The device used to connect a computer to a network is:"
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "ordered": false,
            "items": [
              "(a) Monitor",
              "(b) Keyboard",
              "(c) Network Interface Card (NIC)",
              "(d) Printer"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "3. A network that covers a small geographical area, such as a school or office, is:"
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "ordered": false,
            "items": [
              "(a) WAN",
              "(b) MAN",
              "(c) LAN",
              "(d) Internet"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "4. The topology that uses a central hub or switch is:"
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "ordered": false,
            "items": [
              "(a) Bus Topology",
              "(b) Ring Topology",
              "(c) Star Topology",
              "(d) Mesh Topology"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "5. The OSI model contains:"
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "ordered": false,
            "items": [
              "(a) Five layers",
              "(b) Six layers",
              "(c) Seven layers",
              "(d) Eight layers"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "6. The protocol mainly used to view web pages is:"
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "ordered": false,
            "items": [
              "(a) FTP",
              "(b) DNS",
              "(c) TCP",
              "(d) HTTP"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "7. The main function of a router is to:"
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "ordered": false,
            "items": [
              "(a) Store data",
              "(b) Connect devices within a network",
              "(c) Connect different networks",
              "(d) Display web pages"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "8. DNS is used to:"
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "ordered": false,
            "items": [
              "(a) Transfer files",
              "(b) Protect data",
              "(c) Convert domain names into IP addresses",
              "(d) Connect hardware devices"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "9. The device that converts digital signals for Internet transmission is:"
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "ordered": false,
            "items": [
              "(a) Switch",
              "(b) Hub",
              "(c) Modem",
              "(d) NIC"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "10. The topology that provides the highest reliability is:"
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "ordered": false,
            "items": [
              "(a) Bus topology",
              "(b) Ring topology",
              "(c) Star topology",
              "(d) Mesh topology"
            ]
          },
